@title 2026 Engagement Survey Results
@subtitle Hollow Creek Software, survey closed 2026-09-26
@author People Ops

412 of 474 employees responded to the 2026 engagement survey. Results are reported at the company and department level only.

kpi Response rate | 87% | 412 of 474 | neutral
kpi Overall engagement | 74% | favorable | good
kpi eNPS | 31 | 2026 survey | good

